  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9b857cf2-194e-4357-9578-938999b6f21d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"313\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">「Fel's Advanced Weaponry (FAW)」是一款為遊戲加入即開即用靜態機槍的模組。本作是《Fel's Machine Guns WWII》與《Fel's Machine Guns WWI》的後續作品，並擁有更完善的各項功能。</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">注意：本模組目前僅為概念驗證，不保證會持續進行更新。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4243375f-1e22-4449-9db8-f888ce3a4c62.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"351\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>即開即用的槍枝，無複雜機制。</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>沉浸式射擊與槍械操作體驗</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>專屬第一人稱射擊動畫</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>改良的機械瞄具瞄準功能</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>機槍遊樂場模式（賦予無限彈藥）</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>可自訂槍枝傷害數值</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模組運行需安裝 GeckoLib、IguanaLib 與 Player Animator。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b89cda3c-219a-4553-8434-a5ee7986c96f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"84\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模組目前處於測試階段，歡迎至我的 Discord 回報問題或提供新槍枝建議。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/t5UxRGwwFE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ik4uwXR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"114\" height=\"114\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>若您想支持我的創作，歡迎前往 Patreon 贊助我 :3</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/FelinaMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xRKscZI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></strong></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c1c70cb-19cb-4521-910e-560e0230dfd9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"317\"></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
